# UI

- Name the top-most parent element `Wrapper`.
- Style with `styled-components/native`. Prefix styled components with `S` (`const SButton = styled(Button)`).
- Take colors and font sizes from `design/styles.ts`. Shared layout primitives live in `design/styled.ts`.
- One component function per file.
- If a screen holds more than a short handler of domain logic, move that logic into `hooks/`.
- Use single quotes.

## In-flight actions

Show a small spinner and disable the control that started the request. `Button` already swaps its label for a spinner when `loading` is set.
